    page('Intakeform.html','Request a free onsite assessment in Charlotte','Request a free, approximately 45-minute onsite assessment. Share a general concern; TechDad CLT will contact you about fit and scheduling. Setup is quoted separately.',f'''<section class="guided" data-flow="intake"><div class="app-top"><a class="brand" href="/">TechDad<span>CLT</span></a><a href="/stack-builder.html">Plan finder</a></div><div class="app-stage"><div class="app-card"><div class="eyebrow" id="intake-progress">A simple first step</div><h1 id="intake-title" tabindex="-1">Request a free assessment.</h1><form id="intake" action="https://submit-form.com/rkMLUXlZj" method="post">{markup}<p id="intake-fallback">If this form cannot load, <a href="mailto:hello@ampitsolutions.com">email us</a> or call (980) 399-6020. Nothing is sent until you choose Send request.</p><div id="intake-review" hidden></div><p id="form-status" role="status"></p><div class="app-controls"><button type="button" id="intake-back" class="button light" hidden>Back</button><button type="button" id="intake-next" class="button" hidden>Next</button><button id="send-request" type="submit" class="button" disabled>Send request</button></div><noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to send this form. Please <a href="mailto:hello@ampitsolutions.com">email us</a> or call (980) 399-6020. Nothing has been sent.</p></noscript></form></div></div><div class="app-bottom"><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy &amp; data use</a><button type="button" class="plain-button" data-site-info>Site info</button></div></section>''')
