    body=intro('A guide to your starting plan','Family online safety, one decision at a time.','Choose a practical baseline for children, independent adults or a household with both. No personal data is needed to use the plan finder.')
    body+='<div class="wrap article-layout"><article class="article"><h2>Begin with the person, not the product</h2><p>For children, use the family controls for their device: Apple Screen Time, Google Family Link or Microsoft Family Safety. For independent adults, begin with consent, account recovery, updates and a known-number callback routine—not child supervision.</p><h2>Check the gap before adding a filter</h2><p>Time limits, explicit web content and message-risk alerts are different needs. List the devices involved, check existing protections and test the scenario that concerns you. Multiple VPN-based filters can conflict. Do not treat more subscriptions as more protection.</p><h2>Use the result as a starting point</h2><p>The guide gives a native baseline, an optional tool only where relevant, and practical next steps. Exact OS and app compatibility must be checked before buying. It does not test installed settings, guarantee protection or replace an urgent call to your bank or account provider.</p>'+button('Start the private assessment','/stack-builder.html')+'<h2>Assessment questions, answered</h2>'+''.join(f'<h3>{q}</h3><p>{a}</p>' for q,a in faq)+'<h2>Keep learning</h2><p><a href="/parent-guide.html">Parent setup guide</a> · <a href="/blog/senior-scam-protection.html">Scam-awareness routine</a> · <a href="/how-it-works.html">How protection works</a> · <a href="/solutions-comparison.html">Product facts and sources</a></p></article><aside class="sidebox"><h2>Local help in Charlotte</h2><p>TechDad CLT offers free onsite assessments in Charlotte and surrounding communities, with setup quoted separately.</p>'+button()+'</aside></div>'
